{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Hamburg at ten this morning. The heat was oppressive, and the boat ride from Cuxhaven felt less like travel and more like being marinated in brine. I found no passage for today’s express coach, nor even for Wednesday. I am lodged at the König von Hannover, a tolerable house, though the rooms are damp and the beer tastes of tar.\n\nYour two letters waited for me at the post office. I read them by the window, watching the cranes load timber. I was relieved to hear of Karl’s progress, though I suspect Immanuel is still resisting the arithmetic. I must stay here until Monday’s post wagon, arriving Thursday. It is a long wait, but I shall not complain. The city is busy, the air thick, and I have already spent three thalers on a lunch that was barely worth the effort.\n\nI miss your snuff and your sharp tongue. Write when you can.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795218988,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":208,"prompt_tokens":1115,"total_tokens":1323,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-BxDtLI34D29frUmPcaUtp3Hg4ZkIwJ56","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1115,"prompt_ms":1092.693,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9799937219730942,"prompt_per_second":1020.4147001948398,"predicted_n":208,"predicted_ms":4862.082,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.488318840579712,"predicted_per_second":42.5743539496043}}